# Reference material (past papers, mark schemes, copyrighted PDFs).
# Kept locally so the architecture chat in Cowork can read them when needed,
# but never pushed to the public repo. Pattern matches any folder named
# `reference/` anywhere in the tree, so you can put a per-topic one under
# `new/reference/` or a single shared one at the root, your choice.
reference/

# Internal architecture and authoring docs. They live alongside the code so
# Cowork and author chats can read them, but they shouldn't be in the
# deployed repo. Author briefs, schema specs, decision logs, and proposed
# vocabularies are all internal-only.
AUTHOR_BRIEF_*.md
SCHEMA_*.md
*_decisions.md
*_proposal.md

# OS junk that sometimes turns up.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
